## 1. Materials

The coding workbook (`fgpd coding-sheet export`) has these sheets:

- `transcript`: one row per unit, exactly as the model sees it: `unit_id`, clock time, minutes since start, speaker, text. Agent rows are marked `[AGENT]`.
- `messages`: which original messages belong to which unit.
- `G1`, `G2`, `G3`, `G4`: one empty pattern form per goal (section 9).

Do not edit the `transcript` and `messages` sheets.

